	 JMP I (ERR	/SOMETHING WRONG!
	TAD CMR		/
	LCRE		/
	TAD CMR		/
	SMA CLA		/READ OR WRITE ?
	 JMS I (SYSWAT	/READ, WAIT FOR FLAG
